# Allowlist. The Bun image needs four things; everything else — .env and any
# .env.* copy, SQL dumps and 7z archives, .git, scratch/, the handover — stays
# out of the build context entirely, so it can never land in a layer or the
# BuildKit cache, whatever a future COPY line says.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!tsconfig.json
!src
src/**/*.test.ts
